      "text": "Frequently asked questions."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Have questions? We've got answers."
    },
    {
      "type": "span",
      "text": "I'm not good with taxes. Can I use LeadTax?"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Absolutely. Simple questions + Auto-Fill from CRA. No tax knowledge needed. LeadTax fills in the forms for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "span",
      "text": "Is my information safe?"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "SOC 2 Type II certified. Bank-level encryption. Secure NETFILE transmission."
    },
    {
      "type": "span",
      "text": "What's different from free software?"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Clear pricing before you start, tax practice backing, error checking, accuracy guarantee, Audit Defence on higher plans."
    },
    {
      "type": "span",
      "text": "Is LeadTax a government service?"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "No. Independent, CRA-certified. Not affiliated with or endorsed by the Government of Canada."
    },
    {
      "type": "span",
      "text": "What is Audit Defence?"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "CRA reviews your return → we cover representation fees up to $2,500. Included with Premier ($69) and Self-Employment ($99)."
    },
    {
      "type": "span",
      "text": "How long does it take?"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "About 20 minutes for a basic return with Auto-Fill from CRA."
    },
    {
      "type": "span",
      "text": "What does maximum refund guarantee mean?"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Find a bigger refund elsewhere with the same info? We refund your filing fee."
    },
    {
      "type": "span",
      "text": "What happens after I submit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "CRA processes your return and issues a Notice of Assessment. With direct deposit, refund could arrive in as little as 8 business days (CRA estimate, not guaranteed)."
    },
    {
      "type": "span",
      "text": "What's the refund timeline realistically?"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "CRA says ~2 weeks for e-filed returns. With direct deposit, could be as little as 8 business days. If reviewed, could take longer. We can't predict your specific timeline."
    },
